        "text": "1"
      },
      {
        "id": "d",
        "text": "0"
      }
    ],
    "correctAnswer": "c",
    "explanation": "f'(x) = cos(x) + 2. When x = π, f'(π) = cos(π) + 2 = -1 + 2 = 1.",
    "difficulty": "Easy",
    "sourceFile": "Final calcu 2023-2024.pdf",
    "sourcePage": 1,
    "status": "Verified",
