  {
    "id": "CALC1-FIN-013",
    "subjectId": "subj-calc1",
    "quizId": "quiz-calc1-final-2024",
    "topicId": "top-c1-integ",
    "question": "Evaluate the definite integral: ∫₀⁴ [x / √(x² + 1)] dx =",
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "a",
        "text": "√17 - 1"
      },
      {
        "id": "b",
        "text": "√17"
      },
      {
        "id": "c",
        "text": "√17 - √2"
      },
      {
        "id": "d",
        "text": "√17 - 2"
      }
    ],
    "correctAnswer": "a",
    "explanation": "Let u = x² + 1, du = 2x dx. When x = 0, u = 1; when x = 4, u = 17. The integral becomes (1/2) ∫₁¹⁷ u^(-1/2) du = [u^(1/2)]₁¹⁷ = √17 - 1.",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "sourceFile": "Final calcu 2023-2024.pdf",
    "sourcePage": 2,
    "status": "Verified",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-28T16:31:10.966Z",
