    ],
    "correctAnswer": "b",
    "explanation": "By the standard inverse trigonometric identity, csc⁻¹(x) = sin⁻¹(1/x) for |x| ≥ 1. Therefore, f(3) = sin⁻¹(1/3).",
    "difficulty": "Easy",
