      },
      {
        "id": "d",
        "text": "negative for all x in domain"
      }
    ],
    "correctAnswer": "a",
    "explanation": "f(-x) = (-x)³ ln|-x| = -x³ ln|x| = -f(x). Since f(-x) = -f(x), the function is odd.",
