        "text": "2.67 s"
      },
      {
        "id": "d",
        "text": "50 s"
      }
    ],
    "correctAnswer": "d",
    "explanation": "Power P = V * I = 240 V * 15 A = 3600 W. Time t = Energy / Power = 180,000 J / 3600 W = 50 s.",
