        "text": "-5 V"
      },
      {
        "id": "d",
        "text": "-180 V"
      }
    ],
    "correctAnswer": "a",
    "explanation": "Vab = Va - Vb = W / q. Moving positive charge with negative work implies moving to higher potential: Vab = 30 J / 6 C = 5 V.",
